came to Pennsylvania State University, USA, as a postdoctoral fellow from 2007 to 2009. His present research interests include organic solar cells, colloidal nanocrystal and carbon dots-based optoelectronics, organic-inorganic hybrid perovskite solar cells and flow batteries.
